gloss":"children"},{"surface":"வெண்கோடு","parts":[{"text":"வெண்கோடு","lemma":"வெண்கோடு","gloss":"white tusk"}],"gloss":"white tusk","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கழாஅலின்","parts":[{"text":"கழாஅல்","lemma":"கழாஅல்","gloss":"washing"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"because of / when"}],"gloss":"because of washing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நீர்த்துறை","parts":[{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"நீர்","gloss":"water"},{"text":"துறை","lemma":"துறை","gloss":"ghat / entry point"}],"gloss":"water-ghat"},{"surface":"படியும்","parts":[{"text":"படி","lemma":"படி","gloss":"bathe / plunge"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"bathing / plunging"},{"surface":"பெருங்களிறு","parts":[{"text":"பெருங்களிறு","lemma":"பெருங்களிறு","gloss":"great male elephant"}],"gloss":"great male elephant","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"போல","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இனியை","parts":[{"text":"இனி","lemma":"இனி","gloss":"sweet / pleasant"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ஐ","gloss":"you are"}],"gloss":"you are pleasant"},{"surface":"பெரும","parts":[{"text":"பெரும","lemma":"பெரும","gloss":"O great lord!"}],"gloss":"O great lord!","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"எமக்கே","parts":[{"text":"எமக்கு","lemma":"எமக்கு","gloss":"to us"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"to us indeed"},{"surface":"மற்றதன்","parts":[{"text":"மற்று","lemma":"மற்று","gloss":"but / and then"},{"text":"அதன்","lemma":"அது","gloss":"its"}],"gloss":"but of that"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"துன்னருங்","parts":[{"text":"துன்னருங்","lemma":"துன்னருங்","gloss":"difficult to approach"}],"gloss":"difficult to approach","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கடாஅம்","parts":[{"text":"கடாஅம்","lemma":"கடாஅம்","gloss":"rut / musth"}],"gloss":"rut / musth"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"போல","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்னாய்","parts":[{"text":"இன்னாய்","lemma":"இன்னாய்","gloss":"you are unpleasant / fierce"}],"gloss":"you are unpleasant / fierce","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெரும","parts":[{"text":"பெரும","lemma":"பெரும","gloss":"O great lord!"}],"gloss":"O great lord!","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நின்","parts":[{"text":"நின்","lemma":"நின்","gloss":"your"}],"gloss":"your"},{"surface":"ஒன்னா","parts":[{"text":"ஒன்னா","lemma":"ஒன்று","gloss":"unite / agree (negative)"}],"gloss":"hostile"},{"surface":"தோர்க்கே","parts":[{"text":"தோர்","lemma":"அவர்","gloss":"those people"},{"text":"க்கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"to"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"to those people indeed"}]}],"literal":"When the small children of the village wash its white tusk / like the great male elephant bathing in the water-ghat, / you are pleasant, O great lord, to us indeed! But like its / rut that is difficult to approach, / you are fierce, O great lord, to your enemies!","translation":"Like a great bull elephant bathing at the river-ghat, calmly letting the little children of the village wash his white tusks, you are gentle and sweet to us, O great lord! But like that very elephant when in fierce, unapproachable musth, you are terrifying and bitter to your enemies, O great lord!","modern":"ஊரின் சிறு பிள்ளைகள் தன் வெள்ளைக் கொம்புகளைக் கழுவும்போது, நீர்த்துறையில் அமைதியாக மூழ்கிக் கிடக்கும் பெரிய ஆண் யானையைப் போல, எமக்கு நீ இனியவன், பெருமானே! ஆனால், அதே யானையின் அணுக முடியாத மதநீரைப் போல, உன்னைப் பகைப்பவர்க்கு நீ இன்னாதவன் (கொடியவன்), பெருமானே!","explanation":"This poem is addressed to the chieftain Atiyamāṉ Neṭumāṉ Añci by the famous poet Avvaiyār, belonging to the Puram genre under the theme of 'Arasa Vākai' (the greatness of a king). Avvaiyār beautifully contrasts the king's dual nature using a single, powerful metaphor of a war elephant. To his friends, poets, and subjects, Atiyamāṉ is as gentle and accessible as a giant elephant that patiently allows village children to play with it and wash its tusks at the river ghat. However, to his enemies, he is as terrifying and unapproachable as that same elephant when it is in musth (rut), charging with unstoppable fury. The key words are 'iṉiyai' (you are sweet/pleasant) and 'iṉṉāy' (you are bitter/harsh), which perfectly capture the dual facets of a great ruler's personality—benevolent to his people and ruthless to his foes.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.39],[0.39,0.7],[0.7,1.2],[1.2,2.2],[2.2,2.76],[2.76,3.2],[3.2,3.6],[3.6,4.1],[4.1,4.6],[4.6,5.1],[5.1,5.9],[5.9,6.4],[6.4,7.5],[7.5,7.7],[7.7,7.9],[7.9,8.57],[8.9,9.2],[9.2,9.36],[9.36,9.59],[9.59,9.9]],"female":[[0.0,0.44],[0.44,0.8],[0.8,1.2],[1.2,2.3],[2.3,2.97],[2.97,3.5],[3.5,3.9],[3.9,4.4],[4.4,5.0],[5.0,5.6],[5.6,6.4],[6.4,7.0],[7.0,8.1],[8.1,8.4],[8.4,8.6],[8.6,9.4],[9.8,10.1],[10.1,10.3],[10.3,10.7],[10.7,10.9]]},"sync":[[["ஊர்க்குறு","the small of the village"]],[["மாக்கள்","children"]],[["வெண்கோடு","white tusk"]],[["கழாஅலின்","because of washing"]],[["நீர்த்துறை","water-ghat"]],[["படியும்","bathing / plunging"]],[["பெருங்களிறு","great male elephant"]],[["போல","like"]],[["இனியை","you are pleasant"]],[["பெரும","O great lord!"]],[["எமக்கே","to us indeed"]],[["மற்றதன்","but of that"]],[["துன்னருங்","difficult to approach"]],[["கடாஅம்","rut / musth"]],[["போல","like"]],[["இன்னாய்","you are unpleasant / fierce"]],[["பெரும","O great lord!"]],[["நின்","your"]],[["ஒன்னா","hostile"]],[["தோர்க்கே","to those people indeed"]]]}